WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.900
Compare A vs B. Get a report on A.

2
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:07.400
The rest went nowhere.

3
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.700
And nothing on the page said so.

4
00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:13.500
So take every site named.

5
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:17.100
Capped at three. The cap is the wait.

6
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:20.400
Six minutes is the honest number.

7
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.700
One section holds every company.

8
00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:27.300
Each run numbers its sources from S1.

9
00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:30.500
Follow A citation, arrive at B.

10
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:34.000
Rename as they merge. Three caught.

11
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.600
It still only compares what you name.

12
00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:39.900
A comparison, not a profile.
